{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "a151ddd711161227d82a950ed63f2c31c9b60063d858537a0657d82beadd07f1", "ja": "グルメリポートのお仕事　本番前", "zh": "美食报导的工作　正式拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4000_place", "source_sha256": "1cbe627c95de5a62bd5f39580d39db87faad3ab8a2240c69ec5ee7f3d604923f", "ja": "ファミレス", "zh": "家庭餐厅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4001_p", "source_sha256": "e57c0cb17c6aa7f5555cc7904011bfc0d3a5bef5b611cb10d0e97e82731622fb", "ja": "瑞希、パフェなんて頼んで、大丈夫か？\nこの後、グルメ番組の収録なんだけど……。", "zh": "瑞希，你现在还点圣代，没问题吗？\n等一下就要录美食节目了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4002_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8650a325ec5cd742cef20da3fd1cde6afaee9aaa501c1700e044c27cc5da88b", "ja": "リポートの練習のために、パフェを頼みました。\n私が食べたいからでは……いえ、食べたいですが。", "zh": "我是为了练习报导，才会点圣代。\n并不是因为我想吃……也不对，我的确想吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4003_044miz", "source_sha256": "f6dc8e2913a17faa3db01d719978038af460b8b0324e23b8bcb16187ebba093a", "ja": "グルメリポートで大切なのは、表情だと思います。\nですが、私は、無表情だとよく言われます。", "zh": "我认为美食报导最重要的是表情，\n但我常被人说面无表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4004_044miz", "source_sha256": "7d0b1322b2554e8dae6c68a8ffb7679739d6841862d9261760c1bcb75f21fde4", "ja": "なので、グルメリポートらしい表情ができるように、\nパフェを食べて、リハーサルしたいと思います。", "zh": "所以，为了能做出符合美食报导风格的表情，\n我想透过吃圣代来排练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4005_p", "source_sha256": "eb546f44d506d4fab04010649ca39debd2d086deaa72bdc4f55878f20053101e", "ja": "（その後、瑞希は運ばれてきたパフェを食べた。\n食べている時の瑞希の顔は、いつも通りの表情だった）", "zh": "（接着，瑞希吃了店员送上的圣代。\n吃着圣代的瑞希脸上，是和平常一模一样的表情。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4006_044miz", "source_sha256": "c4b87c62f50ade333bf98316b884cdc1ef025e54816470dd82a886409e06b103", "ja": "……どうしても、適切な表情が作れません。\n{$P$}、どうすればいいのでしょう。", "zh": "……我无论如何都无法摆出适当的表情，\n{$P$}，该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4007_p", "source_sha256": "838ff96f679eb5e86e36f88690d7c5f9003e66e1a401349cace249707d84c304", "ja": "そうだな、\n俺からアドバイスできることと言えば……。", "zh": "这个嘛，\n就我能给你的建议来说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4008", "source_sha256": "e92db14668399d095f6f6e3cc675726ede7d173ea6bd1a14abd8199695995177", "ja": "言葉で表現しよう", "zh": "用言语表达", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4009", "source_sha256": "b5976223f57672904a72cb4f442a25b2c8c36aa3d0c2dc42eaaf6358512a0715", "ja": "ほっぺにクリームが", "zh": "脸上沾到鲜奶油了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4010", "source_sha256": "e3b435de804d0080517c108bc7d3fd8a5cf817dbc7e78ec28ffd375d2f7d621d", "ja": "手品だ！", "zh": "用魔术！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4100_p", "source_sha256": "dc65d0b53845b59d6ed5a5bfb8e22eb28eb1dac6be6b79bad74f8daa462892f8", "ja": "表情に頼らなくても、言葉で\nおいしさを表現すればいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "就算不靠表情，能用言语表达\n食物的美味就好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4101_044miz", "source_sha256": "b510d9ac2c37e6e72ffd718b043b6994b7af44704c1c8340dfef9b8266e878d1", "ja": "……なるほど。それは盲点でした。表情に、\nとらわれすぎたのが敗因です。……そうします。", "zh": "……原来如此，盲点在这里。一直执着于表情\n就是失败的根本原因……我会这么做的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4102_044miz", "source_sha256": "7e6caeb5beec1a10fd4feaeb6de8544a3db0bc0aabfca5c3014b343c68487053", "ja": "リポート、絶対に成功させます。\n……やるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "这次报导，我一定会成功。\n……要上啰，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4200_p", "source_sha256": "c300c7898cb877302d9175d4a481617518c2bbba86e7af4210c1a23a5e707953", "ja": "ほっぺに、クリームがついてるぞ。\nさっき、パフェを食べた時についたんだな。", "zh": "你脸颊上沾到鲜奶油了喔。\n应该是刚刚吃圣代的时候沾上的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4201_044miz", "source_sha256": "ef9f1f19de525fbeae6d0fa1cf8f7419186a1afd4c43358ac8c7bbd20eb19cae", "ja": "なんと。ありがとうございます。……ところで。\n結局、私はリポート、どうすればいいのでしょうか。", "zh": "真没想到，谢谢你……话说回来，\n我的报导到底应该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4300_p", "source_sha256": "8592e753f04e93d6e366f84fa0e0a87f6ec6cfc39b8cb957737332c70f665f32", "ja": "そうだ！　リポートしながら手品もする、\nっていうのは、どうだ？", "zh": "对了！就一边报导一边表演魔术，\n怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4301_044miz", "source_sha256": "ba092d45a787217a983c43b99b0638fa77016713e678e7c6694ef7605af6c358", "ja": "{$P$}。それではグルメより、\n手品に注目が集まってしまいそうです。", "zh": "{$P$}，这样的话，\n引人注目的就不是美食，而是魔术了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4302_044miz", "source_sha256": "52fb17383047bf26ff9a4a6c20affaeb5b7e823dbe4ed7c00d028d0aa72ec28d", "ja": "私はあくまで、おいしさを伝えるべきかと。\n……グルメリポート。", "zh": "我认为应该专注于表现出食物的美味……\n才叫做美食报导。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_4303_p", "source_sha256": "e0f21f3d785dda14d23f73f622561ed9ae48521ebc88353ebe47f9974cd683d6", "ja": "そ、そうだったな。ごめん……。", "zh": "说、说得对，抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
